# Git commit messages — no AI attribution

Never add `Co-authored-by`, `Made-with`, `Generated-by`, `Signed-off-by`, or any AI attribution trailers to git commit messages unless I explicitly request it.

This includes lines such as:
- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`
- `Made-with: Cursor`
- Any similar Cursor or AI co-author / generated-by trailer

Write commit messages as if they are authored only by the human developer working on this project.
